  "claim": "Love Me Tender was featured in a comedy movie that stars an actress who plays Kim Bauer in the series 24.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Just Before I Go. Sentence: Just Before I Go, previously entitled Hello I Must Be Going, is a 2014 black comedy drama film directed by Courteney Cox, in her directorial debut, from a screenplay written by David Flebotte, starring Seann William Scott, Elisha Cuthbert, Olivia Thirlby, Garret Dillahunt, and Kate Walsh.\nPage: Elisha Cuthbert. Sentence: She became known for playing Kim Bauer in the series \"24\", Darcie Goldberg in the college comedy \"Old School\", Danielle in the teen comedy film \"The Girl Next Door\", and Carly Jones in the 2005 remake of \"House of Wax\".\nPage: Love Me Tender (song). Sentence: The song is also featured in many other films such as \"FM, Touched By Love, This is Elvis, Porky's Revenge, Wild at Heart, Die Hard 2, Honeymoon in Vegas, Backbeat, Gaudi Afternoon, Machine Gun Molly, , William Eggleston in the Real World, California Dreamin', Love in Space, Devil's Due, Just Before I Go,\" and \"90 Minutes in Heaven.\"",
  "evidence_text": "Page: Just Before I Go. Sentence: Just Before I Go, previously entitled Hello I Must Be Going, is a 2014 black comedy drama film directed by Courteney Cox, in her directorial debut, from a screenplay written by David Flebotte, starring Seann William Scott, Elisha Cuthbert, Olivia Thirlby, Garret Dillahunt, and Kate Walsh.\nPage: Elisha Cuthbert. Sentence: She became known for playing Kim Bauer in the series \"24\", Darcie Goldberg in the college comedy \"Old School\", Danielle in the teen comedy film \"The Girl Next Door\", and Carly Jones in the 2005 remake of \"House of Wax\".\nPage: Love Me Tender (song). Sentence: The song is also featured in many other films such as \"FM, Touched By Love, This is Elvis, Porky's Revenge, Wild at Heart, Die Hard 2, Honeymoon in Vegas, Backbeat, Gaudi Afternoon, Machine Gun Molly, , William Eggleston in the Real World, California Dreamin', Love in Space, Devil's Due, Just Before I Go,\" and \"90 Minutes in Heaven.\"",
