        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Just Before I Go; Old School; The Girl Next Door; House of Wax; FM; Touched By Love; This Is Elvis; Porky's Revenge; Wild at Heart; Die Hard 2; Honeymoon in Vegas; Backbeat; Gaudi Afternoon; Machine Gun Molly; William Eggleston in the Real World; California Dreamin'; Love in Space; Devil's Due; 90 Minutes in Heaven\n- People: Courteney Cox; David Flebotte; Seann William Scott; Elisha Cuthbert; Olivia Thirlby; Garret Dillahunt; Kate Walsh\n- Songs: Love Me Tender\n- TV Series: 24\n- Characters/Roles: Kim Bauer; Darcie Goldberg; Danielle; Carly Jones\n\nFacts:\n- Elisha Cuthbert became known for playing Kim Bauer in the TV series 24, Darcie Goldberg in the film Old School, Danielle in the film The Girl Next Door, and Carly Jones in the 2005 remake of House of Wax.\n- Just Before I Go, previously titled Hello I Must Be Going, is a 2014 black comedy-drama film.\n- Courteney Cox directed Just Before I Go in her directorial debut.\n- David Flebotte wrote the screenplay for Just Before I Go.\n- Seann William Scott, Elisha Cuthbert, Olivia Thirlby, Garret Dillahunt, and Kate Walsh starred in Just Before I Go.\n- The song Love Me Tender is featured in Just Before I Go and in the films FM, Touched By Love, This Is Elvis, Porky's Revenge, Wild at Heart, Die Hard 2, Honeymoon in Vegas, Backbeat, Gaudi Afternoon, Machine Gun Molly, William Eggleston in the Real World, California Dreamin', Love in Space, Devil's Due, and 90 Minutes in Heaven.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
